{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day moving into your new apartment in a new city, you wake up after a long nap to discover that it is the middle of the night, and you are all alone. With no one around, you must venture out into the dark abandoned streets and uncover the truth behind the mysterious disappearance of all its inhabitants. Use your wits and courage to make your way from one location to another. Interact with challenging puzzles that will help unlock new areas to progress. Explore every area carefully as you never know if you might find something helpful to aid you on your journey. But beware, you are not truly alone in this city. Somewhere along the way you might encounter the horrifying menace known as Project Fiend.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3494360?t=1761925678","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494360/4de36693bfaa0303e0bd26586f2525409d99e9b0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761925678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494360/a8118e2b26691f45eff4d5fc83d556cdee6b9ef3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761925678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494360/a8118e2b26691f45eff4d5fc83d556cdee6b9ef3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761925678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3523740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day moving into your new apartment in a new city, you wake up after a long nap to discover that it is the middle of the night, and you are all alone. With no one around, you must venture out into the dark abandoned streets and uncover the truth behind the mysterious disappearance of all its inhabi